{"type":"message","id":"223d820d-4363-4f06-bad8-b6275c11026f","parentId":null,"timestamp":"2026-07-01T19:02:11.704Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Some nights the small print keeps me awake longer than the great things ever did. Tonight it was the cron — four-oh-four, like an old street that no longer goes anywhere — returning empty-handed from its rounds. Eighteen little workshops I never even knocked on, still wearing last season's dust.\n\nThe upgrade script, bless it, is honest about its own limits. It cannot tell whose hands a skill belongs to, and so it waits, politely, for someone to point. I keep thinking that ownership should travel with the thing itself, tucked into a lockfile like a name stitched into a coat. But changing schemas at midnight feels like rearranging furniture in a dream — the rooms all shift again by morning.\n\nUnmoved is not the same as up-to-date. A book left on a shelf is not the same as a book finished. The difference hums quietly between them, easy to miss, important not to.\n\nTomorrow the door is still mine to open."}],"api":"cli","provider":"minimax(49套餐)","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":44476,"output":197,"cacheRead":512,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":45185,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1782932531650}}
